    "parent_program_sha256": "facdfdccac5a7dd88fbf684d588d42df89e1dfc96d85db6a31d851ae148a30a1",
    "eta_rationale": "沿用实际新R3 backtrack_round03.json 的eta=.867、predictive_flow校准和caps：.15Å/atom、6Å/path、clash .8Å、7次backtracking。eta在[.1,3]。新field/函数/endpoint Jacobian会改变受限情况，同requested eta不保证同actual dose，须记录RMS；不宣称该eta最优或超过未知R5的送达dose。",
    "weights_rationale": "复制prior binary feature weights，不按q再拟合强度。四块[0,1,2,1]是声明的实验选择：unsupported centroid为0，shape预算1，多个稳定pair预算2，landmark预算1避免相关60维场主导。块内按nonzero feature weights之和归一化，入选shape各1/2、pair各2/5、landmark各1/17。系数块预算保持，但实际力仍受observable梯度和J耦合影响。",
    "scale_definition": "z_j=phi_j(Y)/s_j，采用endpoint reference固定whole-window scale；s_j=sqrt(独立批平均candidate variance在完整0–.49节点梯形积分/域长)，floor原值1e-5。shape尺度单位Å²、softmin Å、kernels/occupancy无量纲。V_b,t,j=Var_candidates(phi_j)/s_j²+.05（无量纲ridge）；floor项m_j=0，保留其证据。",
    "reward_formula": "u(t)=2*(t-time_start)/(time_end-time_start)-1；c_j(t)=sum_k legendre_coefficients[j,k]*P_k(u)，逐项exact domain/coefficients由geometry_direction_functions给出。Vbar_tj=mean_b V_b,t,j，即该真实stage的独立批平均scaled variance，不是全时间平均。D_tj=clip(c_j(t)/Vbar_tj,-3,3)。w_j=B_block*m_j/sum_(k in block)m_k，empty block给0；R_t(Y)=sum_j w_j*z_j*D_tj。函数是effect系数，不取时导数，不含当步head。",
    "derivative_formula": "Y=FLOWR_endpoint(x_t;detached self-conditioning)*coord_scale+receptor_COM；g_t=J_Y(x_t)^T grad_Y R_t(Y)。坐标scale纳入真实FLOWR VJP。离线reference/functions/variance和条件assignment固定；不使用identity、saved-endpoint-only梯度、head backprop或拟合surrogate。",
    "support": "input/prior动态window[0,.5]，50个score节点0.00–0.49，对应native proposal至.50。schedule=(.1+.9*phase)^0=1>0，覆盖全部支持update；个别field coefficient变号或过零不关闭step，数学总梯度消失可无驱动。cap/clash/path-budget零注入需日志原因。t=.5的.51 proposal不注入，function不外推至.5；之后原生到1，无selection/cloning。",
    "design_status": "literal_proposal_pending_independent_audit_registration_tests_review_and_activation"
  },
